{"lang": "zh_TW", "eventid": "act49side", "eventName": "辭歲行", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "TA-5", "avgTag": "行動後", "storyName": "雙飛燕", "storyInfo": "百灶改建，疑雲暗湧，書刀不翼而飛。尋覓之際，椿得悉頡的力量與日俱增的事實。與此同時，百灶的改建憑空出現重重困難，大炎與代理人間的嫌隙已悄然出現。\n", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "70_g11_oldpavilion", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "animtext", "attributes": {"content": "<p=1>965年</>", "id": "at1", "name": "group_location_stamp", "style": "avg_only_heavy", "pos": "-400,-200", "block": "false", "p": 1.0}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.0}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "animtextclean", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……情況我清楚了。", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這件事絕對不可讓旁人知曉，要額外當心。", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 12, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你還得再幫我，去做一件事。", "name": "望"}}, {"id": 13, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 14, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 15, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 16, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$wasteland_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 17, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2126_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 18, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#7$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 19, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 20, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2126_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 21, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "大理寺已經開始追查書刀失竊的時間前後，所有接近過天鏡閣的人了。", "name": "均"}}, {"id": 22, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 23, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 24, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "除了我們兄弟姐妹，整個大炎知道有這柄書刀存在的，不超過一手之數。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 25, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2126_1#19$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 26, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是啊，和我擔憂的一點不差。", "name": "均"}}, {"id": 27, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2126_1#17$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 28, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "頡，如果有人想對你不利，我不會坐視不管。", "name": "均"}}, {"id": 29, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#7$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 30, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……如果真的想傷害我的話，也不會用這種手段了。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 31, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所以我猜，這更多是一種警告吧。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 32, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2126_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 33, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "均"}}, {"id": 34, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#7$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 35, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那位陛下是有為之君，他想要所有“人”對他俯首稱臣。在他看來，我們一家的確是“非我族類”了。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 36, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不過我倒是相信，以他的品格，應當不齒於用這柄書刀做些苟且之事。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 37, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2126_1#17$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 38, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但這對你未免過分了。你明明是最不該被猜忌的那一個。", "name": "均"}}, {"id": 39, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#7$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 40, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沒有人會比二姐更清楚，“公正”二字，究竟有多麼難寫。就像大哥說過的……眾口鑠金，辯駁無用。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 41, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2126_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 42, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果他此刻就在這裡，不見得會善罷甘休。", "name": "均"}}, {"id": 43, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 44, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "噗嗤……", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 45, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 46, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我真的不想再見到大哥生氣的樣子，實在是太可怕了。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 47, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2126_1#8$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 48, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那你準備怎麼辦？這件事，你也不打算告訴望？", "name": "均"}}, {"id": 49, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我倒是覺得，他的能耐這種時候反而能派上用場。", "name": "均"}}, {"id": 50, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 51, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 52, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 53, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "頡輕輕搖了搖頭。"}}, {"id": 54, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 55, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我正要拜託二姐……這件事，務必要對二哥保密。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 56, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2126_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 57, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "均"}}, {"id": 58, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 59, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這麼多年來，二哥始終因為各種原因被人所忌憚，新君臨朝以來，他的處境更為微妙。這種時候，絕對不該再將他牽扯進來。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 60, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "更何況，要是讓他知道了，我只怕按他的脾氣，說不定會做出什麼不理智的事呢。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 61, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2126_1#13$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 62, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好，姑且隨你的意。", "name": "均"}}, {"id": 63, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可是，頡，我也希望你能對我坦誠。", "name": "均"}}, {"id": 64, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2126_1#19$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 65, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你究竟有沒有與望一同籌謀什麼？", "name": "均"}}, {"id": 66, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 67, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好姐姐，別審我啦。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 68, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2126_1#17$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 69, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "均"}}, {"id": 70, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#3$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 71, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唉，在你面前果真沒人能撒得了謊。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 72, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2126_1#19$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 73, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "果然。", "name": "均"}}, {"id": 74, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2126_1#17$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 75, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "頡，你應當清楚，你在使用的這一份力量很危險。", "name": "均"}}, {"id": 76, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 77, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我當然知道這是一件有風險的事，可是這麼多年來，承擔著風險的也不只我一人。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 78, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "大哥二哥，還有大姐與你，都為我們這些弟弟妹妹做了許多事，我也不能無動於衷。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 79, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "再怎麼說，我也不想讓自己精心為大家取的這些名字……在歷史上消弭無蹤啊。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 80, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 81, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "all"}}, {"id": 82, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_clothmovement"}}, {"id": 83, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "-20,0", "duration": 0.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 84, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "15,0", "duration": 0.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 85, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 86, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 87, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "見眼前的人依舊愁眉不展，頡輕輕牽起了均的手。這隻常年操弄樂器的手掌心粗糙，握在手中的感覺卻令人安心。"}}, {"id": 88, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 89, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你看，我這不還是好端端地待在這裡？", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 90, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 91, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "放心吧……", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 92, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 93, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 94, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 95, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "其實，我最近做了一個夢，關於我們未來的夢。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 96, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "和黍描述的那一片雪白不同……我看到的是一個不一樣的未來。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 97, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我看到了你們每個人，每個人，都可以真正作為自己而活著。", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 98, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "夢中的畫面是那樣真實，完全不像是一場夢。我甚至有一種預感……", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 99, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我不覺得，那只是一場夢……", "name": "頡"}}, {"id": 100, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 101, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 102, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 103, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 104, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "63_mini04_mountaintop", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 105, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 106, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 107, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$normal_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 108, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1870_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 109, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 110, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "年姑娘，好久不見。", "name": "梁"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1870_1#1$1"}, {"id": 111, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 112, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 113, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 114, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 115, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "喲，圓腦袋。怎麼監工的是你啊？", "name": "年"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#1$1"}, {"id": 116, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你家包工頭呢？又跑去哪裡偷懶了？", "name": "年"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#1$1"}, {"id": 117, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1870_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 118, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "年姑娘誤會了，自從得知百灶要改成移動城市，先生便為了城市的設計操勞起來，最忙的時候，整整有一個月不曾闔眼。", "name": "梁"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1870_1#1$1"}, {"id": 119, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 120, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哇，那個慢性子還有這麼上心的時候？", "name": "年"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#1$1"}, {"id": 121, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1870_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 122, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "先生說，這是炎國的第一座移動城市，意義非凡。留在城市中的每一筆設計，都需要深思熟慮。", "name": "梁"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1870_1#1$1"}, {"id": 123, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "因此，必須要趕在年姑娘對他的設計動手之前，搶先一步完成。", "name": "梁"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1870_1#1$1"}, {"id": 124, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 125, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唉我——！", "name": "年"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#5$1"}, {"id": 126, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 127, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "臭老八，虧我還總是惦記著和他分享點好東西，他在背後就這樣說我壞話？！", "name": "年"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#4$1"}, {"id": 128, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那他現在人在哪裡？我倒要和他理論一番——", "name": "年"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#4$1"}, {"id": 129, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1870_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 130, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在補覺。", "name": "梁"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1870_1#1$1"}, {"id": 131, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "先生已經睡了十天了，但是按照與工部的約定，今天是要交付正門設計稿給工部的日子。", "name": "梁"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1870_1#1$1"}, {"id": 132, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他交代過我，今天無論如何也要把工部的人攔在外面。", "name": "梁"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1870_1#1$1"}, {"id": 133, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 134, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哈哈哈……！我就知道，這才是我認識的那個易嘛。", "name": "年"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#1$1"}, {"id": 135, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#6$1"}}, {"id": 136, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "年"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#6$1"}, {"id": 137, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1870_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 138, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "還有什麼事嗎？", "name": "梁"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1870_1#1$1"}, {"id": 139, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 140, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你是說，易現在還在睡大覺……", "name": "年"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#8$1"}, {"id": 141, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#7$1"}}, {"id": 142, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我突然想起來，幾十年前，易他好像撿了一塊隕鐵啊……應該還留在他的園子裡吧，放在哪裡了？", "name": "年"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#7$1"}, {"id": 143, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1870_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 144, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "年姑娘……我有先生交代的任務在身。今天無論是工部的官員還是你，在下都不能放進界園。", "name": "梁"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1870_1#1$1"}, {"id": 145, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 146, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你怎麼這麼聽他的話？細算起來，幫你打造這副身體的材料還是我給他的，按理說你也得聽我的話。", "name": "年"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#8$1"}, {"id": 147, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 148, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "少說廢話，快點讓開！", "name": "年"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#1$1"}, {"id": 149, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1870_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 150, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "年姑娘，還是萬萬不可……請不要讓在下為難——", "name": "梁"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1870_1#1$1"}, {"id": 151, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 152, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 153, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 154, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_walkfast"}}, {"id": 155, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1630_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 156, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 157, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "梁先生、年小姐，侍郎緊急請兩位前去禁城議事。", "name": "工部官員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1630_1#1$1"}, {"id": 158, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 159, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯？議事就議事，有多緊急？", "name": "年"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#1$1"}, {"id": 160, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$darkness_03_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 161, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1630_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 162, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "百灶城的工程，遇到了一些問題……", "name": "工部官員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1630_1#1$1"}, {"id": 163, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "本來要運到百灶城中的，當下急缺的一批物資，包括異鐵源石等物，紛紛卡在了路上。", "name": "工部官員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1630_1#1$1"}, {"id": 164, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "現在後頭的工程……一團亂麻。", "name": "工部官員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1630_1#1$1"}, {"id": 165, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 166, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "搞什麼……", "name": "年"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#8$1"}, {"id": 167, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "工部那些老頭子，到底行不行啊？", "name": "年"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#8$1"}, {"id": 168, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 169, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 170, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 171, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 172, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "25_g11_yanroom", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 173, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 174, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 175, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_bowl_smash"}}, {"id": 176, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.3, "xstrength": 30.0, "ystrength": 30.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 177, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "怎麼搞的……到底是怎麼搞的？！", "name": "工部尚書"}}, {"id": 178, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "百灶城動工是天大的事，怎麼還能出這種問題？！", "name": "工部尚書"}}, {"id": 179, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "京城附近的馳道修繕向來完備，又不是碰上了天災，怎麼會平白無故地塌陷？如此靠近京城的地方，又何來匪患？！", "name": "工部尚書"}}, {"id": 180, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 181, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 182, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 183, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "大人……要說起來，這幾件事實在是太過蹊蹺。", "name": "疑慮的工部官員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"}, {"id": 184, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "突然發生的坍方，還有莫名其妙消失，又從不該出現的地方出現的物資……", "name": "疑慮的工部官員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"}, {"id": 185, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果這些事背後的確有人在操縱，那此人的目的，應當在惑亂人心。", "name": "疑慮的工部官員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"}, {"id": 186, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "事實上，最近城中已經能聽到不少流言。許多工人都相信，百灶城在此刻動工是犯了凶時。", "name": "疑慮的工部官員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"}, {"id": 187, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 188, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "有人故意要擾亂人心？能是什麼人？", "name": "工部尚書"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"}, {"id": 189, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 190, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$doorknockquite"}}, {"id": 191, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 192, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1633_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 193, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 194, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "尚書大人，禮部尚書求見。", "name": "著急的工部官員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1633_1#1$1"}, {"id": 195, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 196, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "禮部？這個時候找上門來幹嘛，要看我工部的笑話？", "name": "工部尚書"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1633_1#1$1"}, {"id": 197, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1633_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 198, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "回大人，禮部尚書說，知道工部最近事務繁雜，但眼下的麻煩，牽扯到的不只是工部……", "name": "著急的工部官員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1633_1#1$1"}, {"id": 199, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 200, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 201, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 202, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 203, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "47_g6_civilengineermasteroffice", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 204, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 205, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 206, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#1$2", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 207, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 208, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 209, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "椿，你來了。", "name": "司歲台監正"}}, {"id": 210, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "知道找你是有什麼事嗎？", "name": "司歲台監正"}}, {"id": 211, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#4$2"}}, {"id": 212, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "大概是……書刀相關。", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#4$2"}, {"id": 213, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 214, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯。", "name": "司歲台監正"}}, {"id": 215, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在你看來，現在這件事陷入兩難，應該如何解決？", "name": "司歲台監正"}}, {"id": 216, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#5$2"}}, {"id": 217, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我想，若是監正大人……能替她美言幾句，將她的書刀物歸原主……", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#5$2"}, {"id": 218, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 219, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呵。", "name": "司歲台監正"}}, {"id": 220, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#13$2"}}, {"id": 221, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#13$2"}, {"id": 222, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 223, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你接著說。", "name": "司歲台監正"}}, {"id": 224, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#13$2"}}, {"id": 225, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "若真想更改數字，只要繞過她便是，又何必……鬧到這一步呢？", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#13$2"}, {"id": 226, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 227, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "真有意思，她的上一個秉燭人，被彈劾“與代理人關係密切”，之後才告老還鄉……她的確有服人之能啊。", "name": "司歲台監正"}}, {"id": 228, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#13$2"}}, {"id": 229, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她……不，代理人的確有各自的怪脾氣，但他們從未想過要對大炎有任何不利——", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#13$2"}, {"id": 230, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 231, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只要不主動對大炎不利，其他人的怪脾氣，我們的確可以容忍。", "name": "司歲台監正"}}, {"id": 232, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但她……", "name": "司歲台監正"}}, {"id": 233, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你至少應當清楚，你是在與什麼樣的存在打交道，她的權能，對炎國來說究竟代表著什麼。", "name": "司歲台監正"}}, {"id": 234, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_paper2"}}, {"id": 235, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "監正把那份至今尚未呈遞的文件甩在椿的面前，又把一支沾了墨的筆遞給她。"}}, {"id": 236, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "請試試吧。", "name": "司歲台監正"}}, {"id": 237, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "既然你認為可以繞過那代理人，那就試試。把這份文件上的數字改成你喜歡的樣子。", "name": "司歲台監正"}}, {"id": 238, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 239, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 240, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 241, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 242, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "58_g5_dragonpalace", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 243, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 244, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 245, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 246, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 247, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "陛下……關於百灶工程物資受損的事，禮部、工部已經協同調查完畢。", "name": "禮部官員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"}, {"id": 248, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "參與調查的人員一致相信，這一系列事故極有可能是人為造成，而且……應當有一個幕後主使。", "name": "禮部官員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"}, {"id": 249, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那些物資如今已陸續送達百灶，耽誤的工程進度，工部會努力趕上……", "name": "禮部官員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"}, {"id": 250, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 251, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "為何話說一半？", "name": "真龍"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"}, {"id": 252, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你們既然懷疑有幕後主使，那總該有個懷疑對象才對？", "name": "真龍"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"}, {"id": 253, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 254, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "禮部官員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"}, {"id": 255, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 256, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "緊張的官員不敢直視帷幕後的身影，只是餘光瞥見，那位至尊之人正站在書桌前，提筆寫些什麼。"}}, {"id": 257, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這是都挑準了時機來向我下戰書啊。", "name": "真龍"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"}, {"id": 258, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一個告訴我她才是大炎的喉舌，另一個只要稍施手段，就能阻撓大炎偌大的工程，工程想要順利繼續，還是需要由他首肯。", "name": "真龍"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"}, {"id": 259, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那是不是有朝一日，只要願意，他們兩個也能讓大炎的軍隊倒戈？", "name": "真龍"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"}, {"id": 260, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 261, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "陛下，茲事體大。如果真的是代理人為禍，應當立即責令司歲台對其嚴加懲辦。", "name": "禮部官員"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"}, {"id": 262, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 263, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "真龍"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"}, {"id": 264, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不必急躁。", "name": "真龍"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"}, {"id": 265, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沉吟半晌，帷幕後的身影放下了手中的毛筆。"}}, {"id": 266, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "知道這練字是長久的功夫，但不知為何，總覺得怎麼也不見功夫……", "name": "真龍"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"}, {"id": 267, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不過倒是明白了一點，以前太師為什麼非要我花這麼多時間在這上面。", "name": "真龍"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"}, {"id": 268, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "還是要沉得住氣才行。", "name": "真龍"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"}, {"id": 269, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "青年真龍端詳著面前宣紙上的墨跡，似乎是橫豎看來都不滿意，又鎖緊了眉頭。"}}, {"id": 270, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "今夜明月人盡望"}}, {"id": 271, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_scrapebook_quick", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 272, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他拿起手邊的書刀，刮去了那個惹眼的“望”字……"}}, {"id": 273, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只一瞬，紙面又變得潔白如初。"}}, {"id": 274, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他妹妹迂腐，他自己倒是個聰明人，還知道讓物資運抵百灶，做一些表面功夫。", "name": "真龍"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"}, {"id": 275, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "既然他要為妹妹鳴不平，我就成全他的兄妹情。那個數字隨他們去便是。", "name": "真龍"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"}, {"id": 276, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "至於這東西……", "name": "真龍"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"}, {"id": 277, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "本來的確想過，要用這柄書刀做點什麼……", "name": "真龍"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"}, {"id": 278, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "罷了，還回去吧。", "name": "真龍"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1632_1#1$1"}, {"id": 279, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 280, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 281, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 3.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 282, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 283, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 284, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "70_g11_oldpavilion", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 285, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 3.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 286, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 287, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$monastery_sad_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 288, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#13$2", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 289, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 290, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 291, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#13$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 292, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "頡……", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#13$2"}, {"id": 293, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#12$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 294, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你的東西，司歲台已經尋回來了。", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#12$2"}, {"id": 295, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 296, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "頡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1"}, {"id": 297, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "多謝你了。", "name": "頡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1"}, {"id": 298, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#13$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 299, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "頡，實在抱歉……", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#13$2"}, {"id": 300, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 301, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你幫我找回了我丟失的東西，怎麼還反而要向我道歉。", "name": "頡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#8$1"}, {"id": 302, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 303, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沒有關係，物歸原主就好。", "name": "頡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1"}, {"id": 304, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#5$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 305, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "發生了這樣的事，終究是我的失職。", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#5$2"}, {"id": 306, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#13$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 307, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……頡，其實，我一直想問你。", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#13$2"}, {"id": 308, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你說你不願用書刀刪削歷史，這幾年下來，就連錯別字你都不願用它改。那你一直留著這柄書刀，究竟想要做什麼？", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#13$2"}, {"id": 309, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 310, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "忘了嗎？這個問題，你剛來三個月的時候就問過我。當時我不准你用書刀改錯，你還埋怨我呢。", "name": "頡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1"}, {"id": 311, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#2$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 312, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是、是嗎……我、我有點想不起來了。", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#2$2"}, {"id": 313, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 314, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "現在關於衍獸精靈的記載終於被修正了，你就忘了當年的初心嗎？", "name": "頡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1"}, {"id": 315, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#13$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 316, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不，我只是……", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#13$2"}, {"id": 317, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 318, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "聽好。往者不可追是事實，但，就像你我所做的一樣，這並不代表我們要對過去的錯誤視若無睹，甚至文過飾非。", "name": "頡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#10$1"}, {"id": 319, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我留下這柄書刀，只是為了讓人們記得，我們總還有修正錯誤的機會。", "name": "頡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#10$1"}, {"id": 320, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#12$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 321, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯……我明白。", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#12$2"}, {"id": 322, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 323, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$flashback", "volume": 0.7}}, {"id": 324, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 325, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 326, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#5$2"}}, {"id": 327, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "fadetime": 0.0, "keep": "true", "initamount": 0.0, "amount": 0.7, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 328, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "47_g6_civilengineermasteroffice", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 329, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 330, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一個字都改不掉……被破壞的書頁、被勾掉的字跡，都會立刻恢復原狀——怎麼會這樣？！", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#5$2"}, {"id": 331, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#11$2"}}, {"id": 332, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "怎麼會這樣？", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#11$2"}, {"id": 333, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 334, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你看到了，這便是她的權能。", "name": "司歲台監正"}}, {"id": 335, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一百多年前，她還並未如此難纏，那時已經有有識之士提出，應請她離開太史閣，避免讓她直接撰史。", "name": "司歲台監正"}}, {"id": 336, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她本人並無怨言，主動轉到天鏡閣做審校的工作，學宮的課程也減了不少，更多作為顧問出現，就像她二姐一樣。", "name": "司歲台監正"}}, {"id": 337, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但她那過目不忘的本事，執著於歷史的堅持，還有悠長的壽命，對史家而言，實在是個太大的誘惑。", "name": "司歲台監正"}}, {"id": 338, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不知怎的，所有人都等著那個從不出錯的人首肯，她也樂意承擔更多的工作，經手更多的檔案和史料……", "name": "司歲台監正"}}, {"id": 339, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "終於，到了今天，經過她手的史冊文章，只要她不願意，便無人能夠修改。", "name": "司歲台監正"}}, {"id": 340, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#12$2"}}, {"id": 341, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#12$2"}, {"id": 342, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 343, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "至於你心心念念的書刀……頡第一次拿起這柄刀的時候，它只是一柄再普通不過的書刀。", "name": "司歲台監正"}}, {"id": 344, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "數百年之後，當這柄刀已經成了頡貼身的私物，它就不必再削刮竹簡，也能修改字跡了。", "name": "司歲台監正"}}, {"id": 345, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "又過了二百年，這柄書刀曾經誤刪了一代真龍實錄上的一頁。", "name": "司歲台監正"}}, {"id": 346, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那本實錄平時無人翻閱，親歷者也都已故去。於是，一個冒失的史官輕輕一劃，那一頁上記了什麼，再也沒有人想得起來。", "name": "司歲台監正"}}, {"id": 347, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那固然是因為實錄都是孤本，但頡的能力逐年強大，也是事實。", "name": "司歲台監正"}}, {"id": 348, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "此時此刻，若是司歲台或者頡自己要用那柄書刀，為天下削去一字、一句，甚至一段記憶……這並非痴人說夢。", "name": "司歲台監正"}}, {"id": 349, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這書刀不過沾染了些許頡的力量，而頡本人的力量究竟在以何種速度膨脹，不用我多說。", "name": "司歲台監正"}}, {"id": 350, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "大炎的歷史越是厚重，與歷史同生的她，也將越發難以制約。", "name": "司歲台監正"}}, {"id": 351, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "再過個百年千年，如果她仍像現在這樣浸淫於歷史之中，她恐怕會成為比歲獸本身，都更加強大、更加恐怖的力量。", "name": "司歲台監正"}}, {"id": 352, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 353, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "長生的秉燭人怔怔地站在原地，不敢相信自己剛剛聽見了什麼。"}}, {"id": 354, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 355, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$flashback", "volume": 0.7}}, {"id": 356, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 357, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 358, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "fadetime": 0.0, "amount": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 359, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#12$2"}}, {"id": 360, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 361, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "70_g11_oldpavilion", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 362, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 363, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 364, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2127_1#13$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 365, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "已經沒事了，那我便先回天鏡閣了。", "name": "椿"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2127_1#13$2"}, {"id": 366, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 367, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯，路上小心。", "name": "頡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1"}, {"id": 368, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 369, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 370, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "duration": 1.0, "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "-200,0"}}, {"id": 371, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.5}}, {"id": 372, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2", "duration": 1.0, "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "0,0"}}, {"id": 373, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 374, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#11$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 375, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "二哥……？", "name": "頡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#11$1"}, {"id": 376, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 377, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你還好嗎……？", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$2"}, {"id": 378, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 379, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "無事。", "name": "頡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#1$1"}, {"id": 380, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 381, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 382, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2125_1#11$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 383, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "二哥，你果然還是……", "name": "頡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2125_1#11$1"}, {"id": 384, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$2", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 385, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#11$2"}, {"id": 386, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 387, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "兩人沉默著，在兩人相處的很長一段時間裡，他們已經習慣了彼此間默契的沉默。"}}, {"id": 388, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而頡在此時，也分明讀懂了身邊人眼中的情緒。"}}, {"id": 389, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一絲不曾流露的怒火。"}}, {"id": 390, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 391, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 392, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 393, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 394, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 395, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "70_g7_suilingcore", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 396, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 3.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 397, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 398, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$m_sys_act14mini_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 399, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 400, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 401, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這是一百多年前的舊事，我記得那一次與炎國因為那柄書刀而起的爭端。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$1"}, {"id": 402, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這一次，你想讓我看的又是什麼？", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$1"}, {"id": 403, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 404, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.6, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 405, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "我還以為，你會在某個時刻魯莽地闖入這段夢境，將其撕碎。", "x": 300.0, "y": 330.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 406, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "自詡善謀的你難道看不清，你們的結局，如何在那時埋下禍根？", "x": 300.0, "y": 330.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 407, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "人心向背……", "x": 300.0, "y": 330.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 408, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 409, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 410, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 411, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……這不用你提醒。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$1"}, {"id": 412, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "原來當年你並未插手我和那條真龍之間的角力。", "name": "望"}, "figure_art": "avg_2027_wang_1#1$1"}, {"id": 413, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 414, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.6, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 415, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "你知道了，又當如何？自掘墳墓的是你自己，用不著我做什麼。", "x": 300.0, "y": 330.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 416, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "更何況，當年那件事究竟如何引向她最終的死亡，你還遠未看全。", "x": 300.0, "y": 330.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 417, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "已經臨近終局，你做好準備了嗎？", "x": 300.0, "y": 330.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 418, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 419, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 420, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 421, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 422, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 423, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 424, "prop": "hidecgitem", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 425, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 426, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 427, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": ""}}], "OPTIONTRACE": true}